{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/465da213eb39f1533b2b038adffee65e.poster.avif?t=1773843876\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/465da213eb39f1533b2b038adffee65e.webm?t=1773843876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/465da213eb39f1533b2b038adffee65e.mp4?t=1773843876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>With an expressive move-set combining a jetpack with several gadgets, blast through worlds with speed and style, exploring each corner to  beat challenges, face rivals and complete several missions to collect Vultechs, reach the top ranking of the bounty-hunters and win the big prize!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/55aa5593fceb815a262b62fedd9f0d2a.poster.avif?t=1773843876\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/55aa5593fceb815a262b62fedd9f0d2a.webm?t=1773843876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/55aa5593fceb815a262b62fedd9f0d2a.mp4?t=1773843876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER A JETPACK\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using his jetpack created by his friend Safira, Klaus can fly through levels crossing large gaps, reaching higher places and can go way faster than just running! Combine this with his other moves and gadgets to unlock a full range of possibilites allowing you to move the way you want it and to where you want it! Just be skilled enough to manage well it's energy so you can keep it going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/40539b7e4667f2db71ba5217e88d1f5b.poster.avif?t=1773843876\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/40539b7e4667f2db71ba5217e88d1f5b.webm?t=1773843876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/40539b7e4667f2db71ba5217e88d1f5b.mp4?t=1773843876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USE POWERFUL GADGETS\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Needs more movement options? Needs to fight enemies? Find collectibles? Pass through lasers? Or maybe find shortcuts? Use your gadgets so you can do all of these and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/8526f2abd78d49643e064cb330ebb4f1.avif?t=1773843876\" width=1544 height=508 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE RIVALS\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone is that friendly! A treasure hunter, a speedster, a fight club leader, two young rebels and a duo of elite will challenge Klaus at their own terms and he must not only won their challenges but also face them to claim the Vultechs he needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A jetpack that can make you fly through the levels!\u00a0(this one it's obvious at this point)\u00a0Get through large distances and higher grounds with this item that is almost a extension of Klaus' body!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive movement and platforming! Use your jetpack and gadgets the way you want, chain them, make stylish moves and traverse the levels how you like it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rivals to face off! Being a bounty hunter it's not easy, face this rivals and show that you really need to pay your bills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized characters! Meet several stylized characters in these colorful worlds, even though not everyone is so friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge levels to test your skill and speed! How fast can you beat theses levels? And what rank did you get on them? Try your best to get the hidden rank SS! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/13bb4de203078fad52fa208496350af5.poster.avif?t=1773843876\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/13bb4de203078fad52fa208496350af5.webm?t=1773843876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/13bb4de203078fad52fa208496350af5.mp4?t=1773843876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy is something extremely valuable, a bounty hunter fox called Klaus together with his long time friend Safira are broke!\u00a0Now they need explore the galaxy looking for missions and rewards to pay their bills, collecting Energy Gears and the Vultech Crystals, a powerful source of energy! Seems like a company  announced a big prize for the bounty-hunters who gets at the top of their rank, this is a big opportunity right? There is nothing to worry about a company wanting a ton of powerful energy sources! Combine Klaus' agility and skills with his jetpack and gadgets created by his best friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/798f258fbe2b6ab79f793128a7e06226.avif?t=1773843876\" width=1400 height=676 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952330?t=1773843876","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952330?t=1773843876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/007bcc817cd51ea757d498d6b23f04724d02af94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773843876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/007bcc817cd51ea757d498d6b23f04724d02af94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773843876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/465da213eb39f1533b2b038adffee65e.poster.avif?t=1773843876\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/465da213eb39f1533b2b038adffee65e.webm?t=1773843876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"