ivals to face off! Being a bounty hunter it's not easy, face this rivals and show that you really need to pay your bills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized characters! Meet several stylized characters in these colorful worlds, even though not everyone is so friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge levels to test your skill and speed! How fast can you beat theses levels? And what rank did you get on them? Try your best to get the hidden rank SS! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/13bb4de203078fad52fa208496350af5.poster.avif?t=1773843876\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/13bb4de203078fad52fa208496350af5.webm?t=1773843876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952330/extras/13bb4de203078fad52fa208496350af5.mp4?t=1773843876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy is something extremely valuable, a bounty hunter fox called Klaus together with his long time friend Safira are broke!\u00a0Now they need explore the galaxy looking for missions and rewards to pay their bills, collecting Energy Gears and the Vultech Crystals, a powerful source of energy! Seems like a company  announced a big prize for the bounty-hunters who gets at the top of their rank, this is a big opportunity right? There is nothing to worry about a company wanting a ton of powerful energy sources! Combine Klaus' agility and skills with his jetpack and gadgets created by his best friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite